<div data-aud-show="b2b both"><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section_header"><h2 class="heading-h2">Built for B2B - and for retail. Equally.</h2><p class="text-lead">Wholesalers, distributors, manufacturers and retailers - one system for B2B and retail, store, webshop and channels.</p></div><div class="accordion-split"><div class="accordion"><div class="accordion_item is-open"><a type="button" href="#" class="accordion_trigger w-button"><div class="heading-h3">Wholesalers</div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="16" width="16" class="accordion_icon accordion_icon"><path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M3.333 5.667 8 10.333l4.667-4.666"></path></svg></a><div class="accordion_content is-open"><p class="text-lead">Volume catalogs, tiered pricing, dealer portals - B2B selling without spreadsheet chaos.</p><a href="/wholesalers" class="text-link">For wholesalers →</a></div></div><div class="accordion_item"><a type="button" href="#" class="accordion_trigger w-button"><div class="heading-h3">Distributors</div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="16" width="16" class="accordion_icon accordion_icon"><path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M3.333 5.667 8 10.333l4.667-4.666"></path></svg></a><div class="accordion_content"><p class="text-lead">Multi-brand stock, channels and partners in one hub - orders and inventory stay in sync.</p><a href="/distributors" class="text-link">For distributors →</a></div></div><div class="accordion_item"><a type="button" href="#" class="accordion_trigger w-button"><div class="heading-h3">Manufacturers</div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="16" width="16" class="accordion_icon accordion_icon"><path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M3.333 5.667 8 10.333l4.667-4.666"></path></svg></a><div class="accordion_content"><p class="text-lead">Sell to dealers and D2C without a second stack - product data, prices and orders unified.</p><a href="/manufacturers" class="text-link">For manufacturers →</a></div></div><div class="accordion_item"><a href="#" class="accordion_trigger w-button"><h3 class="heading-h3">Retailers</h3><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" class="accordion_icon"><path d="M3.333 5.667 8 10.333l4.667-4.666" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a><div class="accordion_content"><p class="text-lead">POS with fiscalization, store and online from one hub - stock, prices and orders stay in sync.</p><a href="#" class="text-link">For retailers →</a></div></div></div><div data-audience-visual="true"><img src="/images/home/home2-wholesalers.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/home2-wholesalers-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-wholesalers-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-wholesalers-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-wholesalers.jpg 1280w" alt="Wholesale warehouse aisle with pallets and bulk stock" class="image-card"/><img src="/images/home/home2-distributors.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/home2-distributors-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-distributors-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-distributors-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-distributors.jpg 1280w" alt="Distribution hub with conveyor and order totes" class="image-card"/><img src="/images/home/home2-manufacturers.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/home2-manufacturers-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-manufacturers-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-manufacturers-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-manufacturers.jpg 1280w" alt="Manufacturing packaging line with products ready to ship" class="image-card"/><img src="/images/home/home2-retailers.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/home/home2-retailers-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/home/home2-retailers-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/home/home2-retailers-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/home/home2-retailers.jpg 1280w" alt="Retail checkout counter with point-of-sale" class="image-card"/><div class="w-embed"><style is:inline>[data-audience-visual]{display:grid}[data-audience-visual] img{grid-area:1/1;width:100%;height:auto;opacity:0;transition:opacity .18s ease}.accordion-split:has(.accordion>.accordion_item:nth-child(1).is-open) [data-audience-visual] img:nth-child(1),.accordion-split:has(.accordion>.accordion_item:nth-child(2).is-open) [data-audience-visual] img:nth-child(2),.accordion-split:has(.accordion>.accordion_item:nth-child(3).is-open) [data-audience-visual] img:nth-child(3),.accordion-split:has(.accordion>.accordion_item:nth-child(4).is-open) [data-audience-visual] img:nth-child(4){opacity:1}</style></div></div></div></div></section></div>